# Apps offered to testers of beta, dirty and debug builds by the Beta apps app.
# One app per line: package versionCode apk [needs=package] description
# The name, icon and version shown come from the APK itself. The description is
# the rest of the line, one short sentence. needs= (optional) names an app from
# this list that gets ticked too when this one is ticked, e.g. for a plugin.
# Put that app above the ones that need it, apps are installed in list order.
com.kevintresuelo.treble 500004 TrebleInfo.apk Shows whether the system supports Treble and which GSI images fit it.
com.cpuid.cpu_z 7 CPU-Z.apk Shows the CPU, chip, memory, battery and sensors.
aws.apps.usbDeviceEnumerator 81 UsbDeviceInfo.apk Lists the USB devices plugged into the console.
org.fdroid.fdroid 1023052 F-Droid.apk App store for free and open source apps. Allow it as an install source when it asks.
com.sika524.android.quickshortcut 20400 QuickShortcutMaker.apk Makes home screen shortcuts to any screen of any app.
sh.haven.app 8651 Haven.apk SSH, VNC and RDP client with a local Linux terminal.
com.termux 1002 Termux.apk Linux terminal with a package manager for command line tools.
dev.sebaubuntu.athena 17 Athena.apk Shows detailed hardware and system information.
com.ghisler.android.TotalCommander 2490 TotalCommander.apk Two-pane file manager.
com.ghisler.tcplugins.LAN 106 TotalCommanderLAN.apk needs=com.ghisler.android.TotalCommander Plugin for Total Commander: opens Windows (SMB) network shares.
com.ghisler.tcplugins.SFTP 60 TotalCommanderSFTP.apk needs=com.ghisler.android.TotalCommander Plugin for Total Commander: opens SFTP servers.
org.fedorahosted.freeotp 48 FreeOTP.apk Makes two-factor login codes.
dev.imranr.obtainium.fdroid 23563 Obtainium.apk Installs and updates apps straight from their release pages, like GitHub.
com.github.itskenny0.r1ha 103510688 R1HA.apk Home Assistant client for controlling your smart home.
de.szalkowski.activitylauncher 20500 ActivityLauncher.apk Opens hidden screens of apps and makes shortcuts to them.
info.dvkr.screenstream 44002 ScreenStream.apk Streams the console's screen to a web browser on your network.
org.schabi.newpipe 1015 NewPipe.apk Watches YouTube and PeerTube videos without ads or a Google account.
app.pwhs.universalinstaller 42 UniversalInstaller.apk Installs XAPK, APKS and APKM app bundles that the normal installer cannot open.
